# CVE-2026-24049 and CVE-2026-23949 affect wheel and jaraco.context
# vendored INSIDE setuptools/_vendor/ — these are internal copies used only
# by setuptools itself during package installation, NOT exposed to user code.
# They are not exploitable in a running container — setuptools is a build tool.
# Fix: upgrading setuptools replaces these vendored copies.
CVE-2026-24049
CVE-2026-23949
